# A kit on SEQ: REC unlit, the keys put trigs on the steps; REC lit, they play the kit's lanes (and,
# playing, record them, as played: QUANTZE sets how close to the grid they sound); holding SEQ, steps again.
wait 300
tap HOME
turn SELECT -20
turn K3 1
wait 100
turn K3 1
wait 200
expect tp 1 KIND 3
expect tp 1 MODE 1
tap SEQ
wait 200
expect page DRUM
tapkey 0
wait 100
expect steps 1 1
tapkey 0
wait 100
expect steps 1 0
tap REC
wait 100
tapkey 0
wait 100
expect steps 1 0
tap REC
tap PLAY
tap REC
wait 200
key 0 down
wait 60
key 0 up
wait 400
key 2 down
wait 60
key 2 up
wait 400
shot kit_rec.png
expect steps 1 2
press SEQ
tapkey 2
release SEQ
wait 100
expect steps 1 3
tap PLAY
tap REC
wait 200
tapkey 2
wait 100
expect steps 1 2
